                    <div class="trait-desc">Continuous iteration beyond surface answers — committed to getting things right, not just done</div>
                </div>
                <div class="trait-card">
                    <div class="trait-icon">🤝</div>
                    <div class="trait-title">Stakeholder Sensitivity</div>
